    "chunk_size_bytes": 2051,
    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bcd \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Speaker) Hon. (Dr.) Ramanathan Archchuna, would you please raise your matter of Privilege, which states \"Request for leave to raise an urgent Question of Privilege.\"\n\nII\n\n\u0dc0\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dad\u0dcf\u0daf: \u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dab\u0dc0\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0dca \u0d86\u0dbb\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dc2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dcf \u0daf\u0dd3\u0db8 \u0b9a\u0bbf\u0bb1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bbe\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bae: \u0ba4\u0b95\u0bc1\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4 \u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba4\u0bc1\u0b95\u0bbe\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1 \u0bb5\u0bb4\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1\u0ba4\u0bb2\u0bcd PRIVILEGE: PROVISION OF ADEQUATE SECURITY\n\nHon. Deputy Speaker, I respectfully seek your permission to raise an urgent Question of Privilege in Parliament today concerning my personal safety, the continued failure of the Government to provide adequate security to me as a duly elected Member of Parliament and the discriminatory treatment meted out to me as a Representative of the Tamil minority community in Parliament.\n\nI draw your attention to the letter dated 05.06.2026 addressed to me by the Sergeant-at-Arms, Mr. Kushan Jayaratne. The contents of this communication further reinforce my long-standing concern regarding my personal security and protection as a Member of Parliament.\n\nOn numerous occasions, both through written correspondence and Privilege Motions raised in this House, I have informed the Speaker that my personal safety remains under serious threat. I have repeatedly emphasized that the Speaker bears the responsibility of ensuring safety, security and protection of every Member of Parliament without restriction, discrimination or unequal treatment.\n\nUnfortunately, despite my repeated requests and representations, the Ministry of Defence of the present Government has continuously failed to and refused to provide even the minimum security protocol ordinarily afforded to a Member of Parliament. Such failures have exposed me to a significant personal risk while carrying out my Parliamentary duties and public responsibilities."
  },
