    "chunk_size_bytes": 1610,
    "chunk_text": "The Bar Association of Jaffna, by letter dated 30.05.2026 and which I would like to table*, wrote to the Hon. President alleging interference and undue pressure from the Hon. Governor of the Northern Province and a senior Minister in the Government in the process leading to the transfer of the said Judge.\n\nThe Point Pedro Urban Council and the Chavakachcheri Urban Council, whose Chairpersons belong to the All Ceylon Tamil Congress - ACTC - led by the Tamil National Council alliance have been subjected to inquiries by the Governor in the past few months to satisfy the whims and fancy of the ruling party in the Centre. The power of inquiry over local government bodies lies on the Provincial Minister of Local Government as per Section 184 of the Urban Councils Ordinance. While this Government refuses to hold elections to the Provincial Councils, it has been using the office of the Governor in the Northern Province to stifle the work of the elected local government bodies which, in the case of Jaffna, is controlled by opposition parties.\n\nSo, Sir, my Question to the Hon. Minister is as follows:\n\n669 670\n\n[\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dca \u0dc0\u0dca. \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db1\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0dda\u0dad\u0dcf\u0dca \u0db1\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0dd4\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0dda\u0dad\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dc0\u0dda \u0dad\u0dc0\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bb2\u0baf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b95\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0dd4\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0dda\u0dad\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dc0\u0dda \u0dad\u0dc0\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bb2\u0baf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b95\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n2026 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0db1\u0dd2 12"
  },
